:level  TU
:name   Where the momentum goes
:teach  a knock moves the wheels if there is anywhere to move them, and goes INSIDE if there is not
:par    21
:solve  ddddddddddrrrrrrrrrrr
:note   A bench: its par is a walk to the exit that touches nothing. Shove each lane from its left. Row 1, a pinned cart takes the tyre aboard. Row 3, a barrow with its mouth toward the blow takes it; row 5, the same barrow turned round has a closed back, so it only wobbles. Row 7, raccoon, tyre and loaded cart travel as one. Rows 9 and 10, a loaded cart with nowhere to go sheds from the file he is NOT standing behind — shove that one from the left of row 10.
